        "question": {
          "en": "If the work function of a metal is $2.0\\,\\text{eV}$, what is its threshold wavelength in nm? (Take $hc \\approx 1240\\,\\text{eV}\\cdot\\text{nm}$)",
          "hi": "यदि किसी धातु का कार्यफलन $2.0\\,\\text{eV}$ है, तो nm में इसकी देहली तरंगदैर्ध्य क्या है? ($hc \\approx 1240\\,\\text{eV}\\cdot\\text{nm}$ लें)"
        },
        "options": [],
        "correctAnswer": 620,
        "solution": {
          "en": "Threshold wavelength $\\lambda_0 = \\frac{hc}{\\phi} = \\frac{1240}{2.0} = 620\\,\\text{nm}$.",
          "hi": "देहली तरंगदैर्ध्य $\\lambda_0 = \\frac{hc}{\\phi} = \\frac{1240}{2.0} = 620\\,\\text{nm}$।"
        }
