        "correctAnswer": "A",
        "solution": {
          "en": "At depth $d = R$, $g' = g\\left(1 - \\frac{d}{R}\\right) = g(1 - 1) = 0$.",
          "hi": "गहराई $d = R$ पर, $g' = g\\left(1 - \\frac{d}{R}\\right) = g(1 - 1) = 0$।"
        }
