        "chapter": "Complex Numbers",
        "difficulty": "medium",
        "type": "mcq",
        "question": {
          "en": "If $z = 1 + i\\sqrt{3}$, what is the principal argument of $z$?",
          "hi": "यदि $z = 1 + i\\sqrt{3}$ है, तो $z$ का मुख्य कोणांक क्या है?"
        },
        "options": [
          {"id": "A", "text": {"en": "$\\pi/3$", "hi": "$\\pi/3$"}},
          {"id": "B", "text": {"en": "$\\pi/6$", "hi": "$\\pi/6$"}},
          {"id": "C", "text": {"en": "$2\\pi/3$", "hi": "$2\\pi/3$"}},
          {"id": "D", "text": {"en": "5\\pi/6$", "hi": "5\\pi/6$"}}
        ],
        "correctAnswer": "A",
        "solution": {
          "en": "Since $x > 0, y > 0$, $\\text{Arg}(z) = \\tan^{-1}\\left|\\frac{y}{x}\\right| = \\tan^{-1}(\\sqrt{3}) = \\frac{\\pi}{3}$.",
          "hi": "चूँकि $x > 0, y > 0$, $\\text{Arg}(z) = \\tan^{-1}\\left|\\frac{y}{x}\\right| = \\tan^{-1}(\\sqrt{3}) = \\frac{\\pi}{3}$।"
        }
      },
